2 CONT * Karl Åström: son Karl Eugen 14.5.1915 Tuusula
2 CONT * Jean Åström: son Jean Oskar 20.3.1918 Tuusula
2 CONT * Armas Markkanen: son-in-law Armas Markkanen 19.7.1898 Rantasalmi - 8.2.1943 Queensland, Australia (wife Mirjam Eleonora Åström 11.10.1908 Helsinki)
