2 CONT Aleksander Johannes (Alexander Johannes) Leppeniit. *09.04.1883 in Pähu md. [1883-1894  lived in Pähu md]. [1894-1896-, -1898-1917 lived in Ammuta md, single, had no children]. Confirmed 11.04.1899 in Järva-Peetri congregation. 24
2 CONC .08.1917 left from Järva-Peetri congregation and joined some Lutheran congregation in Helsinki (the destination congregation is not mentioned in the register of parishioners of Järva-Peetri). {+07.01.1929 in Helsinki.}  
